              of the Hom-groupoid is hence the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cech+cohomology"} Cech cohomology
              itself:
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi π
                      %mn 0
                    %mi PreSmooth
                    %mn 1
                    %mi Type
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi C
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} {
                    %msub
